        <activityName xml:lang="en">Server, at data center</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Server, at data center
The data center contains an equal share of typical server; UUID: 253c78fe-b59b-365f-9b8d-cc33ea5a03f1
The dataset is an unweighted average of three available server types: rack, blade, and tower. It is assumed that all three types have equal proportion (1/3 for each server).
Location: Global average servers.
Technology: Three server types, namely rack, blade, and tower are considerd.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_253c78fe-b59b-365f-9b8d-cc33ea5a03f1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
